00:04:54.398 --> 00:04:59.538
Frontiers in psychology ran a within-subject test with 193 professional traders.

00:04:59.538 --> 00:05:04.478
the same people deciding on securities that tend to come back and securities that do not.

00:05:05.058 --> 00:05:09.698
